# test-suite.jobs — one harness command per line = one VM = one test, all run in PARALLEL.
# Blank lines and #comments are ignored. Run:  bash vm-jobs.sh test-suite.jobs e2-standard-4 15 25
# Fill in / adjust to the exact scenario flags (bastion-harness --help for the full list).
# This is the "full validation pass" fanned out: every test at once, results in the time of the slowest.
#
# ★ VALIDATION SEEDS: pin the CANONICAL GATE SEED per scenario (the seed the last-green gate used,
#   e.g. b4 -> 1337) — NOT arbitrary seeds. A red must mean "real regression", not "seed rolled bad
#   terrain" (see the b4@seed-1 seed-premise gap). Throughput/corpus runs can vary seeds; validation
#   must not.
--mine-fidelity-scenario --mf-minutes 10 --seed 1337
--dig-access-scenario --seed 1337
--b4-scenario --seed 1337
# add the rest of the regression catalog, one per line, e.g.:
# --mine-fidelity-scenario --mf-minutes 10 --seed 4242
# --wood-cutting-scenario
# --farm-scenario
